# Legacy loose result-file names from before backend/evaluations/ existed
# (see backend/evaluations/README.md) — a benchmark script writing one of
# these to the old bare backend/ location again (e.g. a stray manual run)
# should not get silently re-committed. Everything under
# backend/evaluations/ IS meant to be tracked — that is now the one
# authoritative, versioned location for eval output, not something to
# ignore.
